* Constants

Constants are declared like variables, but with the ⟪GTI18N_964ac515_000001⟫const⟪GTI18N_964ac515_000002⟫ keyword.

Constants can be character, string, boolean, or numeric values.

Constants cannot be declared using the ⟪GTI18N_964ac515_000003⟫:=⟪GTI18N_964ac515_000004⟫ syntax.

